WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:09.202
It's finally the big day!

2
00:00:09.203 --> 00:00:14.878
Today, Aunt Sunny and Tom are getting married!

3
00:00:14.879 --> 00:00:18.034
Sunny: Oh, where are my hairpins?

4
00:00:18.035 --> 00:00:20.505
Mom: I'll look for them, Sunny.

5
00:00:20.506 --> 00:00:22.166
Sunny: And my bouquet!

6
00:00:22.167 --> 00:00:23.960
Where is it?

7
00:00:23.961 --> 00:00:27.954
Mother: It's right here, dear.

8
00:00:27.955 --> 00:00:29.914
Guest: Congratulations, Tom.

9
00:00:29.915 --> 00:00:31.295
Tom: Thank you.

10
00:00:31.296 --> 00:00:32.625
Where are the rings?

11
00:00:32.626 --> 00:00:37.972
Father: They're in your pocket. Relax, Tom.

12
00:00:37.973 --> 00:00:39.828
Mom: Are you nervous?

13
00:00:39.829 --> 00:00:42.390
Sunny: I'm very nervous.

14
00:00:42.391 --> 00:00:45.012
Hana: You look beautiful.

15
00:00:45.013 --> 00:00:48.202
Sunny: Thank you for everything.

16
00:00:48.203 --> 00:00:50.425
Father: It's time.

17
00:00:50.426 --> 00:00:52.621
Mom: Are you ready, Hana?

18
00:00:52.622 --> 00:00:55.911
Hana: Yes, but I'm nervous too.

19
00:00:55.912 --> 00:01:00.855
Mom: Don't worry. You look beautiful, Hana!

20
00:01:00.856 --> 00:01:04.775
Sherrry: Oh, Hana looks like an angel!

21
00:01:04.776 --> 00:01:07.499
Mother: She's so pretty!

22
00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:09.165
Guest 1: Look at the bride!

23
00:01:09.166 --> 00:01:11.262
She's so beautiful!

24
00:01:11.263 --> 00:01:14.865
Guest 2: What a beautiful bride!

25
00:01:14.866 --> 00:01:16.460
Tom: . . . I do.

26
00:01:16.461 --> 00:01:21.130
Minister: And do you, Sunny, take Tom as your loving husband?

27
00:01:21.131 --> 00:01:22.808
Sunny: I do.

28
00:01:22.809 --> 00:01:27.270
Minister: I now pronounce you husband and wife.

29
00:01:27.271 --> 00:01:30.213
Bada: Congratulations, Aunt Sunny!

30
00:01:30.214 --> 00:01:33.310
Congratulations, Uncle Tom!

31
00:01:33.311 --> 00:01:35.096
Tom: Thank you, Bada!

32
00:01:35.097 --> 00:01:38.217
Mom: What a beautiful wedding!

33
00:01:38.218 --> 00:01:42.248
Hana: Thank you for inviting us!

34
00:01:42.249 --> 00:01:46.569
I am happy for Aunt Sunny and Uncle Tom.

35
00:01:46.570 --> 00:01:50.567
They are going to Hawaii for their honeymoon.
